<%#
  ONE REPOSITORY'S CARD (stage 3, S3-2): the README rendered, the latest commit, the current tag,
  links to the commit and history pages. Rendered at the top of a repository's folder panel, and
  under the path bar when a repository is opened inside one (projects/_folder_panel, 2026-11-24),
  before its files — Maker::RepoCard.for already computed everything here from
  Maker::Git::LocalRepo and the port; this partial only lays it out.

  Commits/History repeat links a repository panel's head already carries — deliberately: the head
  stays for when a maker scans the panel headers alone, and the card is a self-contained unit a
  page-searcher or the public page (spec S3-4) can lift on its own.

  THE ROOT CARD CARRIES NO README AND NO EDITOR SINCE 2026-11-05: the project's README is its own
  panel (projects/_readme), and ProjectsController#show builds the root card with `readme: false`.
  A NESTED repository's card still renders its own README here, read-only — that README is not the
  project's.

  Local: card (Maker::RepoCard).
%>
<div class="repo-card">
  <div class="repo-facts">
    <% if card.head %>
      <%= link_to card.head.short_oid, repo_commit_path(card.dir.node_id), class: "mono", data: { turbo_prefetch: false } %>
      <span class="repo-summary"><%= card.head.summary %></span>
      <span class="muted">— <%= card.head.author %>, <%= time_at(card.head.time, style: :relative) %></span>
      <% if card.tags.any? %>
        <% card.tags.each do |tag| %><span class="badge"><%= tag %></span><% end %>
      <% else %>
        <span class="muted">no tag</span>
      <% end %>
    <% else %>
      <span class="muted"><%= card.refusal %></span>
    <% end %>
    <%= link_to "Commits", repo_commit_path(card.dir.node_id), class: "linkbtn small", data: { turbo_prefetch: false } %>
    <%= link_to "History", repo_history_path(card.dir.node_id), class: "linkbtn small", data: { turbo_prefetch: false } %>
  </div>
  <% if card.readme_html.present? %>
    <details class="readme" open>
      <summary>README</summary>
      <div class="markdown"><%= card.readme_html %></div>
      <% if card.readme_note %>
        <p class="muted readme-note"><%= card.readme_note %></p>
      <% end %>
    </details>
  <% elsif card.readme_note %>
    <p class="muted readme-note"><%= card.readme_note %></p>
  <% end %>
</div>
